  "text": "On your 30th of the mother of the faithful, Om Abdullah Ayesha, may Allah be pleased with her, who said, the messenger of Allah, may the blessings and peace of Allah be upon him, said, He who innovates something in this matter of ours that does not of it will have it rejected. It was related by al-Bukhari and Muslim. In one version by Muslim it reads, He who doesn't act which our matter is not in agreement with will have it rejected.",
